From 744537b11f7a109943aa1b7e2b0189026d25cf3d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 17:29:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] rednsd: Chrome's and Firefox's Cloudflare DoH endpoints added
 to the shipped seed

Published anycast addresses of chrome.cloudflare-dns.com (IPv4 and IPv6), the IPv6 addresses of
mozilla.cloudflare-dns.com and cloudflare-dns.com. Public infrastructure only, in its own commit.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/rednsd/doh-seed.txt | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/release/src/router/rednsd/doh-seed.txt b/release/src/router/rednsd/doh-seed.txt
index 5bfe80c87a3..8d457ecfa66 100755
--- a/release/src/router/rednsd/doh-seed.txt
+++ b/release/src/router/rednsd/doh-seed.txt
@@ -13,6 +13,16 @@
 104.16.249.249
 162.159.61.4
 172.64.41.4
+# 2026-11-06 (metal _r4): Chrome's "Secure DNS: Cloudflare" endpoint (chrome.cloudflare-dns.com) and the
+# IPv6 side of the Mozilla and cloudflare-dns.com endpoints were missing
+162.159.61.3
+172.64.41.3
+2803:f800:53::3
+2a06:98c1:52::3
+2803:f800:53::4
+2a06:98c1:52::4
+2606:4700::6810:f8f9
+2606:4700::6810:f9f9
 2606:4700:4700::1111
 2606:4700:4700::1001
 2606:4700:4700::1112
